<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ budget to be released late June - spokesman.</title>
<headline>NZ budget to be released late June - spokesman.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand government's budget will be released in late June, a government spokesman said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>He said a budget policy statement would be released in early March.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
